monlist - list the monsters in your bestiary

Usage: monlist [-f|--file FILE] [-e|--element ELEMENT] [--sort KEY] [--json]

  Show the monsters in a JSON bestiary file

Available options:
  -f,--file FILE           The bestiary file (default: "monsters.json")
  -e,--element ELEMENT     Show only this element: Fire, Water, Grass
  --sort KEY               Sort by KEY: name or hp (default: name)
  --json                   Print the monsters as JSON
  -h,--help                Show this help text
  --version                Show version information